window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Everything I've been taught my whole life has been a lie....</b></p> <p>Hate is a cruel word...but finding out what my mother has done...what she's hidden from me is unforgivable.</p> <p>Add to that, the four men I've let into my life have been keeping secrets from me, too.</p> <p>I have a few truths of my own to reveal that might change everything between us.</p> <p>With the threat of war darkening our world and my ex fated mate on our heels, I don't see how we can survive if we let the past break us apart.</p> <p>Can I find a way to forgive them before it's too late and I lose everything?</p>"; 
